0,"Maria, Dandami | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/daq/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ds-LqS4XkYVKeqflg9qKe8aW6dKIgq4wLcj858tMz4M,Dandami Maria is a stable indigenous language of India. It belongs to the Dravidian language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.,"Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
1,"The Jesus Film - Maria, Dandami / Bastar Koya / Bison... - YouTube",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U5fYzP5bUjo,"The Story of the Life and Times of Jesus Christ (Son of God).According to the Gospel of Luke.(India) Maria, Dandami / Bastar Koya / Bison Horn Maria / Dandam...","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
2,Dandami Maria Tribe: Discover the Iconic Bison Horn Dance,https://www.studyiq.com/articles/dandami-maria-tribe/,"The Dandami Maria (also spelled Dandami Madia or Maria) are a sub-group of the ancient Gond tribe, one of the largest indigenous groups in central India. They trace their origins to the historic Gondwana region and speak the Dandami Maria dialect, a Dravidian language related to Gondi.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
3,Dravidian Language Family - Structure & Dialects - MustGo,https://www.mustgo.com/worldlanguages/dravidian-language-family/,"map The Dravidian language family was first recognized as an independent family in 1816. The term Dravidian was introduced by Robert A. Caldwell in his Comparative Grammar of the Dravidian or South Indian Family of Languages (1856).Maria Dandami. 200,000. India.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
4,Dandami Maria Song | Smithsonian Folkways Recordings,https://folkways.si.edu/borokameli-musicians/dandami-maria-song/world/music/track/smithsonian,"Dandami Maria girls, Porokameli. From Tribal Music of India: The Muria and Maria Gonds of Madhya Pradesh.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
5,Grammar of dandami maria,"https://theswissbay.ch/pdf/Books/Linguistics/Mega+linguistics+pack/Dravidian/Dandami+Maria,+A+Grammar+of+(Pandey).pdf","0.1. People and the Dialect This study presents a descriptive grammar of a Gondi dialect. belonging to Central Dravidian, spoken by the Dandami Marias.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
6,"Bison Horn Maria Dance | Dandami Maria Tribe of Bastar, Chhattisgarh",https://www.insightsonindia.com/2025/12/15/dandami-maria-tribe/,"The Dandami Maria, also known as Bison Horn Maria or Khalpati Maria, are a tribal community belonging to the broader Gond (Koytorias) ethnic group.Linguistically, they speak Dandami Maria, with many also using Gondi dialects, an oral language of Dravidian origin.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
7,Dandami Maria: The Lords of the Bisons - MAGIK INDIA,https://magikindia.com/en/dandami-maria-the-lords-of-the-bisons/,"The Dandami Maria constitute a major branch of the Gond ethnic group, established in the heart of the Bastar plains in the state of Chhattisgarh.","Maria, Dandami",Dravidian
